<title>ITALY: Italy's Crespi H1 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Italy's Crespi H1 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian footwear and synthetic materials group Crespi SpA said it had first half consolidated pre-tax profit of 18.9 billion lire, up 19.8 percent on the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>The company, listed in Milan since last October, posted group operating profit of 20.8 billion lire, up 12.5 percent, on turnover up 2.5 percent to 178.6 billion.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
